            "notes": "A key item for this build is  [Elite Rotator Cuff](item_dfba3349-64b8-4386-8eaf-15bcd1ca6b37) since this will enable to us to:\n1. Stay alive for longer thanks to the higher durantion of Jav Spin and \n2. Do more damage to the team thanks to being able to deflect for longer which also helps us get way more ult charge.\n\nWe also want to start building for survivavility with  [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8) and  [Charged Chassis](item_b2307dff-5e70-4c77-bae2-2b0c2883c5bb) since we are the tank after all and we have to stay alive for the team as much as possible.\n\nIf you still have some left over, same as round one,  [Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089) if you want to play more passive and on site, and  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if you want to be more aggressive.",
