            "notes": "Choices are:\n\n [Centripetal Charge](item_4c59fa91-c687-4c6d-810d-ddb79288315a) which will help us do more damage and reset more cooldowns.\n\n [Hooves of Steel](item_ee26ce74-568d-47ed-8dcf-fb5cc0fbac9d) to help us survive more during the fights we cant get our ult on.\n\nI tend to opt more for  [Centripetal Charge](item_4c59fa91-c687-4c6d-810d-ddb79288315a) since getting ult will become way easier and will basically get 2 ults every fight but if you are in a though spot where you are dying mid fight a lot then  [Hooves of Steel](item_ee26ce74-568d-47ed-8dcf-fb5cc0fbac9d) can help a lot with aleviating that.\n\nStill trying to maintain the best survivavility and make us unkillable and an annoyance to the enemy team we will go for  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \n\nBut if you need more damage, have extra money and picked  [Centripetal Charge](item_4c59fa91-c687-4c6d-810d-ddb79288315a) then you can sell  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) and get  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)",
